Design references (no code copied)
----------------------------------

NetNewsWire (MIT, Ranchero Software): the Reader API sync order and the
offline sync-status queue design informed FolioSync and FolioStorage.
foliate-js (MIT): CSS multi-column pagination approach.
FreshRSS (AGPL-3.0): used only as a server through its public Google Reader
API; no FreshRSS code is included.
BookOrbit and Readest (AGPL-3.0): product and architecture study only; no code
is included.
